{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Tahrir App 讓你直接在相片上書寫文字，內建超過 150 種字體、背景與顏色，亦可加入自己收藏的字體，適合製作宣傳圖、社交貼文或簡報配圖的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-53.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>文字排版更自由的加字工具</h2>\n<p>Tahrir App 通用於 iPhone 與 iPad，相片以可編輯文件形式儲存，方便日後重複修改，並支援復原與重做。內建超過 150 種字體，可經同一 WiFi 網絡的電腦網頁工具加入或移除自訂字體，並按語言排序、隱藏多餘字體。對齊工具能把文字對齊畫面中央或其他文字邊緣，另可加上陰影、底線、外框與刪除線效果，介面簡潔，讓你專注於設計。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-460-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-461-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-462-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-463-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-464-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-465-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tahrir App – Text on image.</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tahrir-app-text-on-image/id1008067212?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:28.141920+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:36:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T19:58:07.179334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:48.753299+00:00","content_hash":"1ba7170b59794c7737e42591ab0be229cd27d24b9ecd059f7738893fa79bcb54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:28.141920+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}